  dialogue:
  - "So\u2026 what do you like to do for fun? Do you have any hobbies outside of
    crafting?"
  - "This again?\r"
  - "Fine, I suppose I enjoy\u2026 observing and watching the world around me, finding
    inspiration in the most minor details. \r"
  - "A flicker of light, the curve of a leaf, the way shadows dance across a room.
    It\u2019s all quite fascinating.\r\n"
  - "Though I must admit, I don\u2019t have much time for leisure, as I mentioned
    before, my work demands my full attention. \r\nCrafting is my life, after all.\r\n"
  - "Crafting is my life, after all.\r"
  responses: []
